# Focus Lock Environment Variables - Template
# Do NOT commit actual secrets to the repository.

# ==========================================
# 1. SUPABASE CONFIGURATION (Shared by Mobile & Extension)
# ==========================================
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key

# ==========================================
# 2. LOCAL DEV AND GRADLE CONFIG (Mobile builds)
# ==========================================
# Android SDK location in WSL if applicable
# ANDROID_HOME=/mnt/c/Users/username/AppData/Local/Android/Sdk
